flowchart TD
    FAIL[Detect sustained regional customer impact] --> IC[Incident Commander evaluates evidence]
    IC --> FREEZE[Freeze routine production changes]
    FREEZE --> VALIDATE[Validate secondary infrastructure + data state]
    VALIDATE --> SCALE[Scale secondary workloads]
    SCALE --> ACTIVATE[Activate required consumers]
    ACTIVATE --> DB[Promote / recover database state as applicable]
    DB --> DNS[Change Route 53 traffic]
    DNS --> SYNTH[Run synthetic patient/API + clinical-event transactions]
    SYNTH --> MON[Monitor recovery]
    MON --> REBUILD[Restore / rebuild primary]
    REBUILD --> RETURN[Return traffic after validation + authorization]

    VALIDATE -. invalid .-> ABORT[Abort recovery]
    SYNTH -. failed .-> ABORT
    ABORT --> ASSESS[Reassess data integrity + security risk]

    TARGETS[RTO design target <= 60 min
    RPO design target <= 15 min
    Must be validated experimentally]
    TARGETS -. governs .-> VALIDATE
